  {
   "@type": "Review",
   "reviewRating": {
    "@type": "Rating",
    "ratingValue": "5"
   },
   "reviewBody": "Made this for a quick dinner.  I added snow peas, red pepper, peanut, sesame seeds, grated carrots, and pan seared chicken pieces,  I used spicy crunchy garlic chili sauce .  I skipped the sriracha and red pepper  with the 1/2 t of the chili oil.  I used Pad Thai noodles , because they were a lot cheaper. Everyone raved about it.",
